    "catalog": "src/World/Render/Textures.hs:27-56 maps the 16 world shape identities to the isoface / isoface_slope_* face-map images under assets/textures/facemap/. They are reference evidence for the original comparison only; the shared solid geometry of hetoimasia-terrain is authoritative. TRA-14 retains them locally, labelled reference-only, under samples/ecce-homo/reference/synarchy-3777d437/facemap/ (see referenceOnlyMasks)."
  },
